{"uid":"modules/verb_manifest.py","name":"verb_manifest.py","qualname":"modules/verb_manifest.py","kind":"module","file":"modules/verb_manifest.py","line":1,"end_line":550,"language":"py","signature":"","params":[],"returns":"","decorators":[],"bases":[],"modifiers":[],"visibility":"public","doc":{"summary":"Typed verb manifests - semantics for routable shell verbs.","description":"Every routable shell command is a verb. Today the registry knows only\nnames, phases and keyword strings (``config/verbs.yaml``, the built-in\n``AUTO_VERBS`` and the command index). This module stores the missing\nsignature: what a verb requires from the world model before it can run,\nwhat facts it produces, what it costs and how loud it is.\n\nManifest document (``config/verb_manifests.yaml``)::\n\n    manifests:\n      lazynmap:\n        version: 1\n        title: Nmap service scan\n        phase: recon\n        description: Discover open ports and service versions.\n        mitre: [T1046]\n        keywords: [scan, ports, services]\n        needs_target: true\n        cost: {tokens: 200, seconds: 300, toolcalls: 1}\n        noise: {weight: 0.7, why: \"full connect scan rings network sensors.\",\n                sigma: [LAZ-010]}\n        preconditions:\n          - {fact: host_known, host: \"{target}\"}\n        effects:\n          - {fact: services_discovered, host: \"{target}\"}\n          - {fact: scan_completed, host: \"{target}\"}\n        idempotent: true\n\nFacts form a closed vocabulary consumed by three surfaces:\n\n- ``plan_check``: semantic chain dry-runs (``apt_chain --dry-run`` stops\n  being pure token resolution and reports proven-unmet preconditions).\n- the detection oracle: ``noise.weight`` is the operator prior that\n  profiles combine with the oracle probability.\n- the planner: ``cost`` and ``keywords`` rank proposals beyond text match.\n\nParsing is fail-safe: an invalid manifest logs and disappears instead of\nbreaking the loop, mirroring :mod:`modules.verb_catalog` behaviour.","params":[],"returns":null,"yields":null,"raises":[],"attributes":[],"examples":[],"notes":[],"see_also":[],"deprecated":"","since":"","style":"plain"},"parent":"","members":["modules/verb_manifest.py::REPO_ROOT","modules/verb_manifest.py::DEFAULT_MANIFEST_PATH","modules/verb_manifest.py::ManifestCost","modules/verb_manifest.py::ManifestNoise","modules/verb_manifest.py::FactPredicate","modules/verb_manifest.py::VerbManifest","modules/verb_manifest.py::parse_predicate","modules/verb_manifest.py::parse_manifest","modules/verb_manifest.py::manifests","modules/verb_manifest.py::manifest_for","modules/verb_manifest.py::facts_for_target","modules/verb_manifest.py::plan_check","modules/verb_manifest.py::coverage"],"inferred_raises":[],"returns_value":null,"value":"","base_uids":[],"subclasses":[],"calls":[],"called_by":[]}
